OL,3,GNEWSACommissioners urge PM to stop
OL,4,Apolice mega-forces
OL,5,
OL,6,FPolice and crime commissioners (PCCs)
OL,7,Facross the South have joined others in
OL,8,Furging the Prime Minister to scrap
OL,9,Fplans for new "mega-forces".
OL,11,FThe commissioners for Thames Valley,
OL,12,FHampshire and the Isle of Wight, and
OL,13,FDorset are among PCCs to sign a letter,
OL,14,Fwhich warns there is no evidence bigger
OL,15,Fforces perform better, and that merging
OL,16,Fthem could mean council tax rises for
OL,17,Fmillions of households.
OL,19,FThe government plans to cut the number
OL,20,Fof police forces in England and Wales
OL,21,Ffrom 43, with reports suggesting it
OL,22,Fcould fall to nine.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
