OL,3,GNEWSACommissioners urge PM to stop
OL,4,Apolice mega-forces
OL,5,
OL,6,FThis month, Met Police Commissioner Sir
OL,7,FMark Rowley proposed between eight and
OL,8,F10 regional forces, warning the current
OL,9,Fsystem was "heading for failure"
OL,10,Fwithout reform.
